### AUTH

### Register new user (no auth required)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newUser1",
  "password": "StrongPass1!"
}

### Example: get CSRF token (Basic Auth as admin)
# 1) Получаем cookie XSRF-TOKEN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}

### Example: use CSRF token for modifying request
# 2) В IDE (IntelliJ HTTP client) можно использовать переменную {{csrf}} из cookie XSRF-TOKEN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/add?id=10&name=TestRoom
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

################################################################################
### USERS CRUD (ROLE_ADMIN for write, ROLE_USER/ADMIN for read)

### Get all users (USER or ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic {{user_basic}}

### Create user (ADMIN only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/add?id=2&name=Bob&email=bob@example.com
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Update user (ADMIN only)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/update?id=2&name=BobUpdated
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Delete user (ADMIN only)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/delete?id=2
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

################################################################################
### ROOMS CRUD + BUSINESS OPS

### Get all rooms (USER or ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic {{user_basic}}

### Create room (ADMIN only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/add?id=3&name=Office
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Turn off all devices in room (ADMIN only, т.к. POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/turnOffAllDevices
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Safe delete room (ADMIN only)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/delete?id=1
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

################################################################################
### DEVICES CRUD + BUSINESS OP

### Get all devices (USER or ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/devices
Authorization: Basic {{user_basic}}

### Create device (ADMIN only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices/add?id=4&name=NewDevice&roomId=1&type=light&on=false
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

### Toggle device (ADMIN only, POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/devices/toggle?id=1
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

################################################################################
### RULES CRUD

### Get all rules (USER or ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rules
Authorization: Basic {{user_basic}}

### Create rule (ADMIN only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rules/add?id=3&roomId=1&eventType=motion&action=notify_user&active=true
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

################################################################################
### EVENTS + LOGS

### Create event (ADMIN only, POST)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events/add
Authorization: Basic {{admin_basic}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{
  "id": 100,
  "deviceId": 2,
  "type": "motion",
  "data": "test"
}

### Get logs (USER or ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/logs
Authorization: Basic {{user_basic}}

################################################################################
### ROOM STATUS

### Get room status (USER or ADMIN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/status
Authorization: Basic {{user_basic}}

